{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>32歲「億萬駙馬」伍富橋與富貴妻子梁兆楹提早迎來愛子，日前更於西貢5,000呎豪宅舉行盛大滿月宴。榮升新手父母 …</p><p></p>\n<p>32歲「億萬駙馬」伍富橋與富貴妻子梁兆楹提早迎來愛子，日前更於西貢5,000呎豪宅舉行盛大滿月宴。榮升新手父母本應喜氣洋洋，豈料太太深夜卻於社交平台大爆湊仔崩潰內幕。這段豪門育兒生活背後竟然暗藏鮮為人知震撼辛酸。</p>\n<h2>伍富橋西貢獨立屋設滿月宴大搞封酒儀式</h2>\n<p>伍富橋與梁兆楹於日前在西貢相思灣高達5,000呎獨立屋庭園內筵開三席，現場掛滿傳統紅燈籠並擺放大量金器及酸薑涼果，充滿喜慶氣氛。滿月宴最特別環節是即場封存多支名酒，寓意留待愛兒成年或遇上人生重要時刻才正式開封。剛足月嬰孩面頰飽滿非常精靈，熟睡時更不經意擺出拉丁舞手勢，似乎完美繼承父親優良跳舞基因。</p>\n<h2>富貴妻梁兆楹深夜大吐苦水爆老公換衫極慢</h2>\n<p>面對日夜顛倒育兒生活，梁兆楹昨日於社交平台首度公開愛兒正面照，更抵死地將兒子形容為「最新款四腳吞金獸」。她大爆愛兒充電極慢但續航力短，內置每四小時狂響高分貝鬧鐘，直言「半夜有佢比tequila上頭更快」。除了大呻疲倦，她亦公開指控伍富橋幫囝囝換衫時手腳極慢，搞到急性子兒子等到激動狂扯自己頭髮抗議，場面相當惹笑。</p>\n<h2>伍富橋提早做老竇愛犬化身保鑣嚴密監視</h2>\n<p>其實早在本月中出席公開活動時，伍富橋已突發宣布愛妻提早近一個月誕下愛情結晶品。雖然BB心急提早報到，但產婦復原力驚人，坐月未足一個月已回復狀態並出關暢飲。自從新生命降臨後，家中不僅兩夫妻生活迎來巨變，連愛犬Pickle亦化身超級金牌監工。每當男主人親自湊BB時，狗狗必定寸步不離並擺出極度嚴肅表情，全程嚴密監視生怕小主人受傷。</p>\n<h2>網民熱議億萬駙馬幸福日常羨慕愛犬極具靈性</h2>\n<p>夫妻兩人連日來高調分享苦中帶甜湊仔點滴，成功吸引大批網民關注及熱烈討論。不少人留言大讚BB熟睡模樣相當可愛，紛紛表示「瞓覺都識跳舞真係好有遺傳天份」，亦有人對狗狗護主行為感到心甜，留言直指「毛孩真係好有靈性」、「狗狗做埋保鑣好盡責」。大批網民湧入留言區送上真摯祝福，並大讚一家三口連同愛犬相處畫面極度溫馨。\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17932687764788221_7136807766ae31c29172b7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"bkn-20261028190113307-1028_00862_001_08b.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17932687764788221_7136807766ae31c29172b7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@sysleungx）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179326877785870716_12532912926ae31c2a437a3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"bkn-20261028190113307-1028_00862_001_10b.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179326877785870716_12532912926ae31c2a437a3.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@sysleungx）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179326877905067541_10233898636ae31c2b6d2f3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"bkn-20261028190113307-1028_00862_001_09b.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179326877905067541_10233898636ae31c2b6d2f3.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@sysleungx）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178823974141049305_15830439546a965f7db756c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"sysleungx_1788172801_3975691721341262669_6235759.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178823974141049305_15830439546a965f7db756c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@sysleungx）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178823975001273333_9376538086a965f868e073.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"伍富橋老婆 梁兆楹 （圖片來源：Instagram@sysleungx）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178823975001273333_9376538086a965f868e073.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：Instagram@sysleungx）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/17866778726125916_2078593176a7e8a70da76a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/17866778726125916_2078593176a7e8a70da76a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@alvinngfukiu）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e4%bc%8d%e5%af%8c%e6%a9%8b/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">伍富橋</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%84%84%e8%90%ac%e9%a7%99%e9%a6%ac/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">億萬駙馬</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%a2%81%e5%85%86%e6%a5%b9/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">梁兆楹</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3532236\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nOct 29 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T12:21:55.227718+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1310,"images":6,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T10:13:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T12:38:45.403420+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T12:18:41.954898+00:00","content_hash":"b0dc2323d13382b8f53ea65b4d3f5a864f178adaf2cedb866f4b8f1c05f2dced","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}